Here is the root cause:
The bug was caused by the system's inability to correctly handle multiple fields that have the same column name but different field names. The original implementation only allowed a single field to be mapped to each column, leading to failures when trying to retrieve or write data for different fields sharing the same column name.

Here is the patch:
